Cell["\<\
h and s are the Hamiltonian and overlap matrices in the full device basis.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->2041192516,ExpressionUUID->"2336a2ad-2961-7342-a048-af906b81127f"],

Cell["\<\
Returns Inverse[z s - h - Total[sigmas]]. Self-energies must be expressed in \
that same basis.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->413884668,ExpressionUUID->"59083176-3ebd-2f48-96be-3e8ef0a5b3cb"],

Cell["\<\
The current shared overlap-transform dispatcher can confuse 2 by 2 or 3 by 3 \
full-device matrix pairs with lead-block input. The example uses four sites \
to avoid this implementation ambiguity.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->708709637,ExpressionUUID->"e459a23d-484f-6445-ab54-09708af15f53"]
}, Closed]],

